    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="63">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 63</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{CVII} Gif gesiðcunde mon fare, þonne mot he habban his gerefan mid him ⁊ his smið ⁊ his cildfestran.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a noble man moves [to a different district], he may take with him his reeve and his smith and his children’s nurse.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a nobleman moves his residence he may take with him his reeve, his smith, and his children's nurse.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif gesiðcunde mon fare, ðonne mot he habben his gerefan mid him ⁊ his smið ⁊ his cild festran.</ab>
